== Exemple

Creer l'objet graphique et lister ses proprietes.

``````matlab
f = figure('Visible', 'off');
ax = axes('Parent', f);
h = area(ax, [1 2 3; 2 1 4]);
names = properties(h(1));
close(f)
``````


